Document only setup steps that match the actual source code in the repository.

Standard project structure may resemble:

banking-application/
├── README.md
├── app/
├── components/
├── public/
├── styles/
├── screenshots/
└── docs/

Environment variables must never be committed.

Use:

.env.example

for variable names without credentials.

Example:

PLAID_CLIENT_ID=
PLAID_SECRET=
SENTRY_DSN=
